WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Example ideas only. Design your own science sites, layout and program.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.400
Include at least 3 obstacles. Where will they create useful route choices?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.600
One obstacle example: what could you change to keep the rover clear?

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.800
Choose your own headings and times. Program each science action.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.000
Test your original mission. Explain your obstacle placement and changes.
